# Same as the cast with Wistfulness's 6 power, but the red mana is spent on Wistfulness: Bot1 is left with white mana (Mox Pearl) alone.
# Tapping Wistfulness takes only the generic {4} off harmonize {4}{R} (CR 702.180a, 601.2f), leaving {R}, which white mana cannot pay, so
# the harmonize cast is not offered. The control: with the Mountain untapped it is, and is cast (the scenario before this one).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Wild Ride
Mox Emerald
Wistfulness
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

